OL,3,GNEWSAAttacks victim's son runs to keep
OL,4,Adad's legacy alive
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe eldest son of the school caretaker
OL,7,Fkilled during the Nottingham attacks
OL,8,Fsays training for the Robin Hood Half
OL,9,FMarathon helped him cope with the
OL,10,Ftrauma of the public inquiry into the
OL,11,Fkillings.
OL,13,FIan Coates, 65, Barnaby Webber and
OL,14,FGrace O'Malley-Kumar, both 19, were
OL,15,Ffatally stabbed by Valdo Calocane, who
OL,16,Falso seriously injured Wayne Birkett,
OL,17,FSharon Miller and Marcin Gawronski in
OL,18,Fthe early hours of 13 June 2023.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
