OL,3,GNEWSAAttacks victim's son runs to keep
OL,4,Adad's legacy alive
OL,5,
OL,6,FDarren Coates, 45, is raising money for
OL,7,FHuntingdon Academy in Nottingham, where
OL,8,Fhis father was a site manager and
OL,9,Fcaretaker for seven years.
OL,11,FHe took part in the 13.1-mile (21km)
OL,12,Frace on Sunday and was met at finishing
OL,13,Fline by Rebecca Riley, head of the
OL,14,Fschool where his father worked.
